My first healer, this was by FAR the longest (real-world time) game I've 
ever played. It spanned a month or two. I know for some of you, this 
isn't much, but typically I play for a week straight. :)

I got incredibly wealthy this game. I must've hit 5 or 6 bones files. I 
can't even remember the beginning, but I know I had a full AK early on. 
The last bones was on Juiblex's lair, complete with Demogorgon (that was 
interesting...). I had a hell of a time finding the actual pile of loot; 
it was underwater, and I'd filled in four wrong locations before I found 
the right pile. By the end I think I'd encountered enough to put 
together 4 or 5 full AKs.

5 wishes spent on 4 Magic Markers and a cockatrice corpse at the end. 
Most of those markers were used for scrolls of charging to keep full the 
8 or so wands of death I amassed.

There's not much else to say. The beginning of the game was too long ago 
for me to remember much. I never polymorphed anything, largely because I 
didn't find anything to polymorph with until Juiblex's bones and because 
I didn't NEED anything.

I did manage one stupid ascension trick: going to my reward with a 
